<title>CANADA: CANADA DOLLAR WEAKENS ON INTEREST RATE SPECULATION.</title>
<headline>CANADA DOLLAR WEAKENS ON INTEREST RATE SPECULATION.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3915/1.3955	   ASIAN CLOSE     1.3890</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3825   SUPPORT 1.3976     HI 1.3923   LO  1.3892</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3923/28   HI 1.3943     EUROPE OPEN     1.3902</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3901/06   LO 1.3911     HI 1.3912   LO  1.3900</p>
<p>----------------------MARKET COMMENT-------------------------</p>
<p>* The Canadian dollar weakened to C$1.3937 (US$0.7175) in moderate trading on Monday as market expectations of a Bank of Canada interest rate hike failed to materialize, traders said. * They said the release of Canadian housing data, which showed an unexpectedly lower number of housing starts in July, added to the negative tone of the currency.</p>
